<header><p class="st-kicker">republic · British Isles</p><h1 class="st-title">Irish Republic</h1><p class="st-meta">1919 CE – 1922 CE · capital Dublin</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The revolutionary republic declared in 1916 and established by Dail Eireann in 1919, which fought the War of Independence against British rule.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/easter-rising">Easter Rising</a> of 1916 proclaimed an Irish Republic. After <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sinn-fein">Sinn Fein</a> won most Irish seats in the 1918 general election, its members met in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dublin">Dublin</a> on 21 January 1919 as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dail-eireann">Dail Eireann</a>, adopted a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/irish-declaration-of-independence">Declaration of Independence</a> and created a government, with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eamon-de-valera">Eamon de Valera</a> as president from April 1919.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The republic built a counter-state: <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dail-eireann">Dail</a> courts, a loan raised by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/michael-collins">Michael Collins</a>, local councils and the Irish Republican Army, which fought the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/irish-war-of-independence">War of Independence</a> against British forces from 1919 to 1921. It was recognised by no foreign government.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>After the truce of July 1921, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anglo-irish-treaty">Anglo-Irish Treaty</a>, approved by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dail-eireann">Dail</a> in January 1922, replaced the republic with the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/irish-free-state">Irish Free State</a>, a dominion. The split over the Treaty led to the Irish Civil War.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/irish-republic.jpg" alt="Irish Republic" width="320" height="160"><figcaption>Image: Éire · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Ireland.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>1919 CE – 1922 CE